WEBVTT

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>Mt. Fuji is incredibly large.</i>

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:38.490
<i>It's also a much harder 
climb than we'd expected.</i>

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:43.490
<i>Hinata-san and I are putting all our 
efforts into reaching the summit.</i>

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:47.870
<i>Each step we take is on Aoi-san 
and Kaede-san's behalf as well.</i>

00:01:49.530 --> 00:01:50.960
Aoi-chan?

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:55.510
New Climb 11
I've Had Enough!!

00:01:53.410 --> 00:01:54.360
Aoi-chan?

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:57.550
How is your headache?

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:02.270
Well... it's better than 
it was, but still there.

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:03.500
I see...

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.580
It's almost dawn.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:06.980
Do you want to watch the sunrise?

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:11.370
Since we're here, why not 
make that bit of effort?

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:13.480
Okay...

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:15.620
It's cold outside.

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:17.140
Wear an extra layer on top, okay?

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:21.340
<i>Oh, right...</i>

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:24.260
<i>There's the down jacket Mom loaned me...</i>

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:27.750
<i>I ache...</i>

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:30.750
<i>I don't want to go walking.</i>

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:34.720
<i>Almost there...</i>

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:36.510
<i>Almost there...</i>

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.970
<i>I'm sure that's the torii gate at the summit.</i>

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:41.610
<i>Almost there...</i>

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:42.930
<i>Almost there!</i>

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:58.030
Mt. Fuji Summit
Sengen Taisha Shrine

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:58.030
Oh, yeah, the sunrise!

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:03.990
How about if we stand here?

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:04.770
Okay!

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:11.360
<i>The sky is lightening...</i>

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:17.340
<i>Everybody's facing the same direction.</i>

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:19.930
<i>What a feeling of unity.</i>

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:39.720
Summit sunrise! Amazing!

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:54.500
I'm really glad we came!

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.500
Yes!

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:03.000
It sure is pretty.

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:07.820
<i>It really is...</i>

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:09.190
<i>pretty...</i>

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:10.840
<i>And yet...</i>

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:16.480
<i>Why can't I feel or do anything?</i>

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:18.730
<i>It's frustrating...</i>

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:21.200
<i>It's just so frustrating!</i>

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:24.910
 

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:24.910
 

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:26.910
Yes, we're at the summit.

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:28.910
Is Aoi all right?

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.670
I think she'll be fine.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.460
She'll feel better after 
descending the mountain.

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.670
<i>Okay, we'll descend right away too.</i>

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:37.790
There's no need for you to rush.

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:40.670
Since you're up there now, 
why not take the basin walk?

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:42.430
Basin walk?

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:45.250
<i>You circle around the caldera.</i>

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:48.970
<i>It only takes about an hour and a half 
to two hours. Maybe give it a try?</i>

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:53.640
<i>We'll climb down to the Fifth Station ahead 
of you, so just call once you arrive there.</i>

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:56.190
Mt. Fuji Summit Shrine

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:56.190
Summit Cane Branding Spot

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:59.190
Highest Point 3776 M

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:59.190
<i>To be honest, my legs are pretty tired...</i>

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:02.090
Hinata-san!

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:08.570
Mt. Fuji Summit Shrine

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:08.570
Summit Cane Branding Spot

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.440
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:08.570
Kokona-chan, let's have lunch 
and then do the basin walk.

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:12.820
This box lunch is delicious.

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:14.250
So's the pork miso soup!

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:17.040
Mountain climbing sure works up an appetite!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.380
It really does take a lot of energy.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:22.960
We've still got lots of walking to do, 
so we'd better replenish our energy!

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:24.000
Right!

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:29.720
<i>Wow...</i>

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:33.560
<i>It was too dark to see well earlier,</i>

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:36.480
<i>but here there's just rocks, clouds, and sky.</i>

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:39.870
It's as if we're taking a stroll in the sky.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:40.860
Yeah.

00:05:41.510 --> 00:05:43.610
<i>The sun is blinding...</i>

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:46.610
<i>The cold wind feels great!</i>

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:52.120
Offerings

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:52.120
<i>It's like a cactus!</i>

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.960
Summit Sengen Taisha Shrine

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:09.820
You're writing a letter?

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:11.760
I thought I'd send one to Aoi.

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:15.520
At the least, I want to convey 
how I'm feeling right now.

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:18.770
Good idea! I'll write a letter too!

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:22.060
Mt. Fuji Summit Post Office

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:22.440
Let's go!

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.070
It's just a bit further!

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:37.520
<i>My head and feet hurt.</i>

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:39.230
<i>But...</i>

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:40.710
<i>I still have to walk...</i>

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:42.390
Take it slowly.

00:06:42.390 --> 00:06:43.790
You mustn't overdo it.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:45.170
Right...

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:50.510
<i>Why doesn't she look unhappy to be with me?</i>

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:53.530
<i>I'm making so much trouble for her.</i>

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:57.850
<i>Our goal lies so far away.</i>

00:06:58.420 --> 00:07:02.060
<i>We walk and walk, but don't get any closer.</i>

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:03.980
<i>When will we get there?</i>

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:06.110
<i>How much longer...</i>

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.860
<i>will I have to keep doing this?</i>

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:14.170
Kaede-san...

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:16.890
How much longer will it take?

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.250
Say, Aoi-chan.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.350
Want to take a quick break?

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:29.720
It's better not to think too much about 
how long it'll take to get there.

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:33.130
The more you think about that, the more 
it feels like you aren't getting anywhere.

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:36.770
If you clear your mind of 
thoughts and just walk,

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:39.270
you'll get there before you know it.

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:41.030
Okay...

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:43.770
<i>Why?</i>

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:49.520
<i>Why am I going mountain climbing, 
when it hurts so much?</i>

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:50.900
<i>Why did I...</i>

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:53.780
<i>go so far to get to a place like this?</i>

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.440
<i>My feet hurt.</i>

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:02.370
<i>But...</i>

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:04.870
<i>This is the last leg!</i>

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:18.050
We made it!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:25.030
The Mt. Fuji rim peak, 3776 meters...

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:26.610
Highest Point

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:30.110
Highest Point in Japan Mt. Fuji

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:30.110
We're at the highest point in Japan!

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:46.620
Banzai! Banzai!

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:50.590
Mt. Fuji's awesome!

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:55.340
Banzai! Banzai! Banzai!

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:59.350
Banzai! Banzai! Banzai!

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:01.720
Highest Point in Japan

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:14.530
I've had the full Mt. Fuji experience!

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:20.530
Good, you've arrived.

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:21.660
You must be tired.

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:23.800
Yes, she's resting.

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:26.280
There's still time until the bus leaves,

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:27.960
so maybe go look for souvenirs?

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:29.470
Sure thing.

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:32.090
Yes.

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:33.500
That's right.

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.970
I'll ride you the next time I come.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:37.760
It's a promise.

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:39.410
Kokona-chan?

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:41.190
Uh, yes?!

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:42.510
Let's go look for souvenirs.

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:43.800
Okay!

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:57.740
Mt. Fuji Local Specialties

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:57.740
Rest House

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:55.020
The descent was pretty tough too!

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:56.570
My feet are all worn out.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:57.740
Yes...

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:01.520
But, I'm glad I got all the brands for my cane.

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:04.990
Cushions

00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:07.630
Aoi-san was wanting one of these.

00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:08.160
Mt. Fuji Local Specialties{match scene from Ep9}

00:10:08.430 --> 00:10:10.330
Okay, I'll buy one for her!

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:13.340
Aoi-chan?

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:15.640
It's about time to catch the bus.

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:17.040
Okay...

00:10:18.690 --> 00:10:19.930
Have you called home?

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.330
Oh, that's right.

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.680
<i>I really don't want to call Mom.</i>

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:29.210
<i>Considering how headstrong I was earlier,</i>

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:31.210
<i>I'm sure she's going to scold me.</i>

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:35.320
<i>Aoi?</i>

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:36.570
Mom?

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:37.880
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:40.460
<i>I got worried when you didn't call!</i>

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:42.080
I'm sorry.

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:43.580
I messed up.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:46.530
<i>You sound different. Are you all right?</i>

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:48.230
Yeah...

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:50.530
I'm about to get on the bus back.

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:54.460
I'm very sorry I forgot to call you.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:57.260
<i>What are you saying? Didn't you try your best?</i>

00:10:58.010 --> 00:10:59.420
<i>Are you well enough?</i>

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:01.220
<i>Can you get home just fine?</i>

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:02.580
Yeah.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.240
<i>Why?</i>

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:09.590
<i>After I made Mom worry so much, 
why would she be encouraging me?</i>

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:13.610
<i>I don't know how I'm supposed to react anymore.</i>

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:15.980
Hey there!

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:17.470
Thanks for waiting!

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:18.230
Aoi-san!

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:37.280
I'll take on Mt. Tsurugi next!

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:35.540
<i>I'm exhausted.</i>

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:38.790
<i>My head and feet hurt.</i>

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:40.800
<i>I'm tired...</i>

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.880
<i>Tired of feeling like this.</i>

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:45.390
<i>Tired of mountains...</i>

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:59.980
To Be Continued
